# Build context is the repo root, but the Dockerfile only COPYs the lockfile
# pair and the dev entrypoint. Allowlist those; ignore everything else so
# standalones, vendor/, docs, and host node_modules never hit the daemon.
*
!docker-entrypoint.dev.sh
!wealth-app-next/
!wealth-app-next/package.json
!wealth-app-next/package-lock.json
